// v1 — changes need a pull request approved by a project manager.
//
// Every FriendlyFire gRPC service implements DependencyHealthService next to
// the standard grpc.health.v1 service:
//   - grpc.health.v1 answers "am I running?" (used by Docker healthchecks).
//   - DependencyHealthService answers "am I running AND can I reach
//     everything I call?". Each service checks its database, HTTP
//     dependencies, and calls CheckDependencies on every gRPC service it
//     calls, using the same clients the real features will use.
//     The result is a tree, so the Gateway can show the whole system.
//
// Callers: Gateway (for /api/health/deep) and every service that calls
// another service.

